<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS FIRST DOWNHILL TRAINING RUN.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS FIRST DOWNHILL TRAINING RUN.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colo 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the top 10</p>
<p>finishers in the opening training run in the women's World Cup</p>
<p>downhill.</p>
<p>1. Isolde Kostner (Italy) one minute 50.52 seconds</p>
<p>2. Stefanie Schuster (Austria) 1:50.62</p>
<p>3. Hilary Lindh (United States) 1:51.07</p>
<p>4. Alexandra Meissnitzer (Austria) 1:51.38</p>
<p>5. Tie Martina Ertl (Germany) 1:51.65</p>
<p>Barbara Merlin (Italy) 1:51.65</p>
<p>7. Tanja Schneider (Austria) 1:51.83</p>
<p>8. Katja Seizinger (Germany) 1:51.84</p>
<p>9. Kate Pace Lindsay (Canada) 1:51.95</p>
<p>10. Megan Gerety (United States) 1:52.04</p>
</text>
